BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bitter Gold
DTSTART:20250516T200000Z
DTEND:20250516T213500Z
DTSTAMP:20250516T200000Z
UID:gCY5lE7XDP
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 83 mins (1h23m)\n\nIn this pulse-pounding neo-wester
 n thriller set in the cutthroat artisanal mining industry in the deserts o
 f northern Chile\, 16-year-old Carola must take control of the family busi
 ness and stave off greedy\, gold-seeking rivals after her father gets seri
 ously injured.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/bitter-gold\n\nAlso playin
 g at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3 (Thu 22 May\, 6:00 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Monk in Pieces
DTSTART:20250516T220000Z
DTEND:20250516T234500Z
DTSTAMP:20250516T220000Z
UID:HrAR7Fy7U4
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nAs avant-garde multihyphenate gen
 ius Meredith Monk approaches her final project\, the immersive “Indra’
 s Net\,” she and her greatest protégés and collaborators relive and re
 interpret her storied career’s most enduring works. Director Billy Sheba
 r scheduled to attend. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/monk
 -in-pieces\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3 (Sat 17 M
 ay\, 9:00 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
