UID:V0wnYBMDtD
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 87 mins (1h27m)\n\nAs Indigenous teenager Ku Stevens
  aspires to go to the University of Oregon and become an Olympic-level cro
 ss-country runner\, we learn of his family’s history through his great-g
 randfather’s narrow escape from the horrible clutches of an Indian board
 ing school. Director Paige Bethmann\, producer Jessica Epstein\, and cast 
 member Ku Stevens scheduled to attend. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.n
 et/festival/remaining-native\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown
  House 1 (Sat 17 May\, 2:30 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
